Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Event
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarEvent publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|page|Staging Test Page|
		|site|Site Name|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And CalendarNavigator goto Edit Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title - Staged Edit|
	And CalendarEvent publish
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title - Staged Edit|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CalendarScheduler select Specific Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title - Staged Edit|
	And CalendarEvent assert Event Not Editable
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent view Unavailable Calendars Not Present
		|unavailableCalendarList|Site Name|
	And CalendarEvent view Available Calendars
		|availableCalendarList|Test Test|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Day|
	And CalendarScheduler goto Add Via Day View
	And CalendarEvent view Unavailable Calendars Not Present
		|unavailableCalendarList|Site Name|
	Then CalendarEvent view Available Calendars
		|availableCalendarList|Test Test|
Scenario: Schedule Publish To Live With Event And Resource
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|calendarName|Site Name|
		|eventTitle|Site Name Staged Event|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|pageStaging|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteURL|true|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Site Name Staged Event|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|calendarName|Test Test|
		|eventTitle|Test Test Live Event|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|pageStaging|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteURL|true|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Test Test Live Event|
	And CalendarResource add
		|calendarResourceName|Calendar Resource Name|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Calendar add
		|calendarName|Calendar Resource Name|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|
	And Calendar view
		|calendarName|Calendar Resource Name|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CalendarScheduler view Specific Event Not Present
		|eventTitle|Site Name Staged Event|
	And CalendarResource view Resource Name Not Present
		|calendarResourceName|Calendar Resource Name|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Test Test Live Event|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging schedule Publish To Live PG
		|scheduleTitleName|Staging Schedule Title|
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Site Name Staged Event|
	And CalendarEvent view
		|eventTitle|Test Test Live Event|
	Then Calendar view
		|calendarName|Calendar Resource Name|
		|calendarType|Other Calendars|

